<% content_for :title, "AI One-Stop 솔루션 — XimTier" %>

<div class="v3-root">
<style>
.v3-root {
  --c-rausch:#ff385c; --c-canvas:#ffffff; --c-ink:#222222; --c-body:#3f3f3f;
  --c-muted:#6a6a6a; --c-hairline:#dddddd; --c-navy:#0a1124; --c-navy2:#16325c;
  --c-teal:#00c8c8; --c-blue:#2563eb;
  --grad-teal:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#00c8c8);
  --font-sans:'Airbnb Cereal VF',Circular,Inter,system-ui,'Apple SD Gothic Neo',sans-serif;
  --font-mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
  font-family:var(--font-sans); color:var(--c-body);
}
.v3-wrap { max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }
.v3-eyebrow { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--c-teal); margin-bottom:16px; }
.v3-hero { background:var(--c-navy); padding:100px 0 72px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
.v3-hero::before { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; background:radial-gradient(800px 500px at 75% 20%,rgba(0,200,200,0.12),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(600px 400px at 10% 85%,rgba(37,99,235,0.16),transparent 60%); pointer-events:none; }
.v3-hero__inner { position:relative; }
.v3-hero__headline { font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,50px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.22; color:#fff; word-break:keep-all; margin:0 0 20px; max-width:700px; }
.v3-hero__sub { font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; color:#a7b1c7; max-width:560px; margin:0 0 36px; word-break:keep-all; }
.v3-section { padding:88px 0; }
.v3-section--dark { background:var(--c-navy); color:#fff; }
.v3-section--alt { background:#f7f8fa; }
.v3-section__eyebrow { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--c-teal); margin-bottom:14px; }
.v3-section__title { font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,36px); font-weight:700; color:var(--c-ink); line-height:1.25; margin:0 0 14px; word-break:keep-all; }
.v3-section--dark .v3-section__title { color:#fff; }
.v3-section__lead { font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; color:var(--c-muted); max-width:620px; word-break:keep-all; }
.v3-section--dark .v3-section__lead { color:#a7b1c7; }
/* 10-solution grid */
.v3-sol-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:14px; margin-top:44px; }
@media(max-width:1000px){ .v3-sol-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); } }
@media(max-width:620px){ .v3-sol-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }
.v3-sol-card { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09); border-radius:14px; padding:20px 16px; transition:border-color 0.2s,background 0.2s; }
.v3-sol-card:hover { border-color:rgba(255,56,92,0.4); background:rgba(255,56,92,0.06); }
.v3-sol-card__num { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; color:var(--c-rausch); letter-spacing:0.12em; margin-bottom:10px; }
.v3-sol-card__title { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; line-height:1.4; word-break:keep-all; }
/* common flow */
.v3-flow { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0; margin-top:44px; }
.v3-flow-step { flex:1 1 200px; padding:24px 20px; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); position:relative; }
.v3-flow-step:last-child { border-right:none; }
@media(max-width:700px){ .v3-flow-step { flex:1 1 100%; border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); } .v3-flow-step:last-child { border-bottom:none; } }
.v3-flow-step__arrow { position:absolute; right:-8px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:var(--c-teal); font-size:16px; z-index:1; }
@media(max-width:700px){ .v3-flow-step__arrow { display:none; } }
.v3-flow-num { font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; color:var(--c-teal); letter-spacing:0.14em; margin-bottom:8px; }
.v3-flow-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin-bottom:6px; word-break:keep-all; }
.v3-flow-desc { font-size:12px; color:#7a8aab; line-height:1.5; word-break:keep-all; }
/* slide */
.v3-slide-img { border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 20px 60px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); margin-top:40px; }
.v3-slide-img img { width:100%; height:auto; display:block; }
.v3-slides-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin-top:40px; }
@media(max-width:700px){ .v3-slides-row { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
/* bar */
.v3-bar { padding:40px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--c-hairline); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; }
.v3-btn-primary { display:inline-block; padding:14px 28px; background:var(--c-rausch); color:#fff; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; border-radius:10px; text-decoration:none; transition:opacity 0.15s,transform 0.15s; box-shadow:0 8px 24px -4px rgba(255,56,92,0.4); }
.v3-btn-primary:hover { opacity:0.88; transform:translateY(-1px); }
.v3-back { font-size:14px; color:var(--c-muted); text-decoration:none; }
.v3-back:hover { color:var(--c-ink); }
</style>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="v3-hero">
  <div class="v3-wrap">
    <div class="v3-hero__inner">
      <div class="v3-eyebrow">Chapter 04</div>
      <h1 class="v3-hero__headline">AI One-Stop 솔루션</h1>
      <p class="v3-hero__sub">데이터 로딩부터 AI 최적화 보고서까지 — 10가지 산업 솔루션이 하나의 플랫폼에서 완결됩니다. 도메인별 전문 분석 없이도 즉시 활용 가능합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 10 Solutions -->
<section class="v3-section v3-section--dark">
  <div class="v3-wrap">
    <div class="v3-section__eyebrow">10 Industry Solutions</div>
    <h2 class="v3-section__title">10가지 AI 산업 솔루션</h2>
    <p class="v3-section__lead">회의·설문·SNS·상권·소상공인·병의원·설비·제품개발까지 산업별 맞춤형 AI 분석 솔루션을 제공합니다.</p>
    <div class="v3-sol-grid">
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 01</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 스마트 Meeting 분석</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 02</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 스마트 설문 분석</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 03</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 스마트 SNS 분석</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 04</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 축제·행사 YX 최적화</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 05</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 전통시장·상권 YX 최적화</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 06</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 소상공인·매장 YX 최적화</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 07</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 광고형 병의원 YX 최적화</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 08</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 설비고장·예지보전 YX 최적화</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 09</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI SNS 기반 제품개발</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-sol-card">
        <div class="v3-sol-card__num">SOL 10</div>
        <div class="v3-sol-card__title">AI 설문 기반 제품개발</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="v3-slides-row">
      <div class="v3-slide-img" style="margin-top:0;">
        <img src="/deck-slides/slide-60.jpg" alt="AI One-Stop 솔루션 개요">
      </div>
      <div class="v3-slide-img" style="margin-top:0;">
        <img src="/deck-slides/slide-61.jpg" alt="AI 솔루션 목록">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 공통 흐름 -->
<section class="v3-section v3-section--dark" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="v3-wrap">
    <div class="v3-section__eyebrow">Common Flow</div>
    <h2 class="v3-section__title">모든 솔루션의 공통 흐름</h2>
    <p class="v3-section__lead">10가지 솔루션은 동일한 4단계 흐름으로 작동합니다. 데이터만 준비하면 AI가 나머지를 처리합니다.</p>
    <div class="v3-flow">
      <div class="v3-flow-step">
        <span class="v3-flow-step__arrow">›</span>
        <div class="v3-flow-num">FLOW 01</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-title">데이터 로딩</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-desc">엑셀·CSV·DB 등 다양한 형식의 데이터를 플랫폼에 업로드합니다.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-flow-step">
        <span class="v3-flow-step__arrow">›</span>
        <div class="v3-flow-num">FLOW 02</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-title">AI 현황 분석</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-desc">AI가 데이터를 탐색하고 핵심 패턴과 현황을 자동 분석합니다.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-flow-step">
        <span class="v3-flow-step__arrow">›</span>
        <div class="v3-flow-num">FLOW 03</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-title">What-If / Reverse What-If 최적화</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-desc">조건 변경 시 결과 예측 및 목표 달성을 위한 조건을 역산합니다.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-flow-step">
        <div class="v3-flow-num">FLOW 04</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-title">AI 종합 최적화 보고서</div>
        <div class="v3-flow-desc">분석 결과와 최적화 전략을 담은 보고서를 자동 생성합니다.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="v3-slides-row" style="margin-top:40px;">
      <div class="v3-slide-img" style="margin-top:0;">
        <img src="/deck-slides/slide-64.jpg" alt="공통 분석 흐름">
      </div>
      <div class="v3-slide-img" style="margin-top:0;">
        <img src="/deck-slides/slide-68.jpg" alt="AI 최적화 보고서">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Bottom CTA -->
<section class="v3-section" style="padding:60px 0;">
  <div class="v3-wrap">
    <div class="v3-bar">
      <%= link_to "← 홈으로", home_path(locale: I18n.locale), class: "v3-back" %>
      <%= link_to "데모 신청", demo_path(locale: I18n.locale), class: "v3-btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</div>
